<title>FRANCE: EU adds 150,000 tonnes free-mkt oats for export.</title>
<headline>EU adds 150,000 tonnes free-mkt oats for export.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union on Thursday added 150,000 tonnes of oats to free-market stocks available for export to non-EU countries, France's grain office ONIC said. --Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
